note "Guide level 3's whole bar at 760 px: hovering the speaker slides the slider out (enter width 0, opacity 0) and leaving slides it back; a fourth workspace's dot grows in. Read again from the traces after still-pointer: the pointer rests at 545,26 on the speaker at k1, and the opening row brings the slider's box (x from 530 at k1) under it, so from k2 the slider is hovered and its knob is the hovered 16 px, not 14, until the leave at k15; that is the only change, on that one node at k2 to k14 (the track's fill and the knob's place move by the 1 px the larger knob takes from the travel). Hover now follows what moved under a still pointer, as spec.md 6.3 says."
